9"><p class="_9srqtxk _9srqtxv">Terranor</p></a></li><li class="_1euyk710"><a class="_1euyk712" href="/companies/1492"><p class="_9srqtxk _9srqtxv">Vertiseit</p></a></li><li class="_1euyk710"><a class="_1euyk712" href="/companies/1439"><p class="_9srqtxk _9srqtxv">Vivesto</p></a></li><li class="_1euyk710"><a class="_1euyk712" href="/companies/1487"><p class="_9srqtxk _9srqtxv">W5 Solutions</p></a></li><li class="_1euyk710"><a class="_1euyk712" href="/companies/1413"><p class="_9srqtxk _9srqtxv">Waystream</p></a></li></ul></div></div></div></div><div class="_1t2hu014"><div class="ma4p810"><div class="kadgwu0"><div class="kadgwu1"><div class="ma4p81b"><main><div class="_10iqpxd0"><div class="_10iqpxd3"><div class="_10iqpxd4"><div class="_10iqpxd5"><div class="_1kjf62k0 _1kjf62k1 _1kjf62k0 _1kjf62kb _1kjf62kr"><p class="_9srqtxm _9srqtx16">Pre-results note</p></div></div><h1 class="_9srqtx0 _9srqtxv">IBBM momentum versus opex - Q3 preview</h1></div><div class="_10iqpxd6"><div class="_10iqpxd7"><div><p class="_9srqtxi _9srqtx1b">Maria Karlsson Osipova</p></div><div class="_10kas2m0"><p class="_9srqtxk _9srqtx10">2026-10-22</p><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="circle" class="svg-inline--fa fa-circle " role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" color="#666565" width="3" height="3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M256 512A256 256 0 1 0 256 0a256 256 0 1 0 0 512z"></path></svg><p class="_9srqtxk _9srqtx10">06:34 CEST</p></div></div><button class="wy4fk30 wy4fk34 wy4fk37"><p class="_9srqtxc _9srqtx16">Download</p><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="17" fill="none"><g stroke-miterlimit="10" clip-path="url(#download_svg__a)"><path stroke="#EFC0BB" d="M8 12.312V.832M2.898 7.207l5.1 5.107 5.1-5.107"></path><path stroke="#00343E" d="M13.098 12.945V15.5h-10.2v-2.554"></path></g><defs><clipPath id="download_svg__a"><path fill="#fff" d="M0 .5h16v16H0z"></path></clipPath></defs></svg></button></div></div><section class="_10iqpxd8"><p class="_9srqtxc _9srqtxv _10iqpxd8"><span><strong>We forecast Q3 net sales of SEK105m (up 21% Y/Y) and EBITDA of SEK16m, corresponding to a 15% margin. This implies broadly flat sequential sales versus the strong Q2, and normalising growth as the Dignitana acquisition is fully annualised in the comparable base. Despite cutting our 2026e EBITDA by 21%, we maintain our longer-term growth and margin assumptions. Following peer multiple and model updates, we adjust our fair value range to SEK72–106 (71–106) per share.</strong><br /><br />We expect Q3 to show continued revenue growth of 21% Y/Y. The key operational question in our view is whether the stronger insurance-based billing model (IBBM) traction in Q2 (in utilisation, cap volumes and system orders) was sustained in Q3. We believe the H2 revenue bridge remains well underpinned by the order book and expected contribution from the five OneOncology practices from Q4, although quarterly developments may remain lumpy.<br /><br />Margins remain the key swing factor. We forecast a Q3 gross margin of 66%, EBITDA of SEK16m and EBIT of SEK10m, corresponding to 15% and 10% margins, respectively. While our EBITDA estimate represents a significant improvement from Q2 2025 (+c100%), it is below our previous expectation (we lower our Q3 2026–Q1 2027e EBITDA by SEK2m–9m, reflecting an elevated opex base for longer). This partly reflects continued chemotherapy-induced peripheral neuropathy (CIPN) engagement and associated launch-preparation costs, while the Q2 result also showed the cost base was increasing Y/Y.<br /><br />Europe first for CIPN, while the US is a 2027e event. Following the FDA’s shift to a De Novo pathway, we expect European commercialisation from late-Q4 2026 and a US launch around Q2–Q3 2027. We continue to assume no material CIPN revenue in our estimates.<br /><br />We believe the most important data points will be continued IBBM site growth, but also cap volumes and utilisation, alongside the development in the opex base. We continue to see a solid fundamental story in Paxman. Our estimates suggest a 2027 EV/EBITDA of c10x, versus a peer median of c12x. Our forecast revisions and peer multiples lead to a minor update to our fair value range to SEK72–106 per share.</span></p></section></div></main></div></div><div class="kadgwu2"><div class="_9wj4ua0"><div class="if95qy0"><div class="if95qy4"><div class="_1kjf62k0 _1kjf62k1 _1kjf62k0 _1kjf62ka _1kjf62kr"><p class="_9srqtxm _9srqtx16">Sweden</p></div><div class="_1kjf62k0 _1kjf62k1 _1kjf62k0 _1kjf62ka _1kjf62kr"><p class="_9srqtxm _9srqtx16">Healthcare</p></div></div><div class="if95qy1"><div class="if95qy5"><div class="if95qy2"><a class="if95qy3" href="/companies/1595"><h3 class="_9srqtx2 _9srqtxv">Paxman</h3></a></div><div class="_10j9co55 _10j9co50"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 15 11" class="_10j9co55"><g clip-path="url(#SEflag_svg__a)"><path fill="#0052B4" d="M0 .688h15v10H0z"></path><path fill="#FFDA44" d="M5.625.688H3.75V4.75H0v1.875h3.75v4.063h1.875V6.625H15V4.75H5.625z"></path></g><defs><clipPath id="SEflag_svg__a"><path fill="#fff" d="M0 .688h15v10H0z"></path></clipPath></defs></svg></div></div><button class="wy4fk30 wy4fk34 wy4fk3d"><p class="_9srqtxc _9srqtx16">Subscribe</p></button></div></div><div class="re9e3w0 re9e3w1"><div class="re9e3w2"><p class="_9srqtxn _9srqtxv">Latest share price</p><div class="re9e3w3"><div class="re9e3w4"><p class="_9srqtxe _9srqtxv">SEK</p><h3 class="_9srqtx2 _9srqtxv">66.9</h3></div><div class="re9e3w4"><h3 class="_9srqtx2 _9srqtxz">0.75<!-- -->%</h3></div></div><div class="re9e3w5"><p class="_9srqtxe _9srqtx17">19 Nov 2026 15:12 CET</p></div></div><div class="re9e3w2"><p class="_9srqtxn _9srqtxv">Fair value range</p><div class="re9e3w5"><p class="_9srqtxe _9srqtxv">SEK</p><h3 class="_9srqtx2 _9srqtxv">72.0</h3><h3 class="_9srqtx2 _9srqtxv">—</h3><h3 class="_9srqtx2 _9srqtxv">106.0</h3></div><div class="re9e3w5"><p class="_9srqtxe _9srqtx17">22 Oct 2026</p></div></div><div class="re9e3w2"><p class="_9srqtxn _9srqtxv">Market cap</p><div class="re9e3w4"><p class="_9srqtxe _9srqtxv">SEK</p><h3 class="_9srqtx2 _9srqtxv">1,570</h3><div class="re9e3w4"><p class="_9srqtxe _9srqtxv">m</p></div></div></div><div class="re9e3w2"><p class="_9srqtxn _9srqtxv">Next report</p><h3 class="_9srqtx2 _9srqtxv">Q3</h3><p class="_9srqtxe _9srqtx17">20 Nov 2026</p></div></div><div class="_9wj4uaa"><h3 class="_9srqtx2 _9srqtxv">Key stats</h3><div class="_1f585ou0"><div class="_1f585ou3"><div class="_1f585ou4"><div class="_1f585ou5" style="grid-template-columns:minmax(100px, auto) repeat(1, minmax(70px, auto))"><div class="_1f585ou6 _1f585oub _1f585ouc"><p class="_9srqtxi _9srqtxv">Year</p></div><div class="_1f585ou7 _1f585ou6 _1f585oub"><p class="_9srqtxi _9srqtxv">2026e</p></div><div class="_1f585oua" style="grid-column:1 / 3"></div><div style="grid-column:1 / 3"></div><div class="_1f585ou8 _1f585oub _1f585ouc"><p class="_9srqtxk _9srqtxv">EPS</p></div><div class="_1f585ou7 _1f585ou8 _1f585oub"><p class="_9srqtx6 _9srqtxv">1.22</p></div><div class="_1f585ou9" style="grid-column:1 / 3"></div><div style="grid-column:1 / 3"></div><div class="_1f585ou8 _1f585oub _1f585ouc"><p class="_9srqtxk _9srqtxv">EPS (Adj.)</p></div><div class="_1f585ou7 _1f585ou8 _1f585oub"><p class="_9srqtx6 _9srqtxv">1.22</p></div><div class="_1f585ou9" style="grid-column:1 / 3"></div><div style="grid-column:1 / 3"></div><div class="_1f585ou8 _1f585oub _1f585ouc"><p class="_9srqtxk _9srqtxv">Sales Growth</p></div><div class="_1f585ou7 _1f585ou8 _1f585oub"><p class="_9srqtx6 _9srqtxv">30.61%</p></div><div class="_1f585ou9" style="grid-column:1 / 3"></div><div style="grid-column:1 / 3"></div><div class="_1f585ou8 _1f585oub _1f585ouc"><p class="_9srqtxk _9srqtxv">EPS Growth (Adj.)</p></div><div class="_1f585ou7 _1f585ou8 _1f585oub"><p class="_9srqtx6 _9srqtxv">6427.97%</p></div><div class="_1f585ou9" style="grid-column:1 / 3"></