jyszwi4"><div class="jyszwia"><p class="_9srqtxi _9srqtxs">About DNB Carnegie Access</p><p class="_9srqtxn _9srqtx19">DNB Carnegie Access aim is to connect listed companies with the capital markets. Through top ranked public equity research and broad distribution via written reports, seminars, video, and podcasts, we increase visibility and investor understanding for small- and medium-sized companies, both among institutional and private investors.</p><p class="_9srqtxn _9srqtx19">Along with corporate finance, market making and certified advisory we provide a complete product offering to our clients.</p></div></div></div><div class="jyszwi2"><div class="jyszwi5"><div class="jyszwia"><p class="_9srqtxi _9srqtxs">DNB Carnegie Access</p><div class="jyszwi3"><a class="nrynoe0" href="/"><p class="_9srqtxn _9srqtx19">Home</p></a><a class="nrynoe0" href="/equity"><p class="_9srqtxn _9srqtx19">Equity Research</p></a><a class="nrynoe0" href="/media"><p class="_9srqtxn _9srqtx19">Media</p></a><a class="nrynoe0" href="/calendar"><p class="_9srqtxn _9srqtx19">Calendar</p></a><a class="nrynoe0" href="/events"><p class="_9srqtxn _9srqtx19">Events</p></a><a class="nrynoe0" href="/about"><p class="_9srqtxn _9srqtx19">About</p></a></div></div><div class="jyszwie"><a href="mailto:cr@carnegie.se" class="wy4fk30 wy4fk31 wy4fk3f" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><p class="_9srqtxn _9srqtx16">Contact us</p></a></div></div><div class="jyszwi5"><div class="jyszwia"><a href="https://www.carnegie.se/private-banking/" class="jyszwif" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><p class="_9srqtxi _9srqtxs">Private Banking</p></a><p class="_9srqtxn _9srqtx19">Tailored wealth management. Your financial future, personalized.</p></div><div class="jyszwie"><a href="https://www.carnegie.se/private-banking/" class="wy4fk30 wy4fk31 wy4fk3f" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><p class="_9srqtxn _9srqtx16">Learn more</p></a></div></div><div class="jyszwi5"><div class="jyszwia"><a href="htt